y get  access to the documentation to prove to  our auditors that GCP was secure and he  was up to scratch the other thing that  we were able to do is work close to the  kms team and working with those guys you  could really see that there was a focus  and a road map that really took security  to the next  level there's a number of services that  GCP offered we couldn't get elsewhere  and examples like the identity aware  proxy which you can't get anywhere else  and encryption at rest by default but  also the further step that enables us to  supply encryption keys to Google so the  Google can't even an unencrypted the  data if they wanted to the identity of a  proxy for us is a really nice service  because it basically enables us to  protect all of our internal dashboards  without having the complicated set up  over VPN and having to get our users to  install VPN clients install credentials  have to factor or it's all baked into  the identity of a proxy and because  we're users of Google App Engine it just  means that there's no additional setup  for anyone within the company so those  are all really strong factors that  suggest that Google really cares about  security and it enables us to trust  Google with all of our data
 

